{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Landed as Gerrit 3431 PS2 → 6b88c9dd03a1544d655fdf2df0950275ec0cf84d (LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, 0 unresolved). PS1's Verified -1 was the anyio worker-exit race in test_a_finished_gate_drive_releases_its_event_loop[raised]. That race is fixed by unselfish-finnicky-whooper (705b495a590), and PS2 is a rebase onto it with no code change.\n\nLocal make verify on the pre-rebase branch: 21,400 passed, and the only failure was that same race.\n\nThe 5 new tests in test_verify_identity_reclaim_perf.py fail on the pre-fix tree (6b88c9dd03a~1 with the test file copied in: 5 failed) and pass on the fix. The only change to existing tests is the banner tests' cache clear.\n\nTiming, enforced `verify-identity --all` with no boundary, one dry-run workdir:\n- Original history: 27 min 1 s. Before the fix it did not finish in over 5.5 h.\n- Rewritten history: 20 min 40 s, and 20 min 19 s on a re-run with the final build.\n\nBoth histories FAIL with identical counts: 42,612 verified / 874 unsigned / 7,007 bad-signature. No verdict fails only on the rewritten history, so no child bug was filed. The cause is tracked in starving-sphalerite-skua. Results are recorded here and on polite-antivirus-bedbug.\n\nWindows sweep for the subprocess change: test.yml run 44454009531 on 6b88c9dd03a."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795060129330557472,"uuid":"7a4a7708-3624-4f61-a49c-f1868ab8c9dc"}